<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

  <title>Deshipolli — Coming Soon</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: #f7f7f5;
      color: #171717;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .container {
      padding: 30px;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 52px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -2px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .logo span {
      color: #e63946;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      background: #171717;
      color: white;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(42px, 8vw, 80px);
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      letter-spacing: -3px;
    }

    p {
      max-width: 550px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      color: #666;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .footer {
      margin-top: 50px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #999;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .logo {
        font-size: 40px;
      }

      h1 {
        letter-spacing: -2px;
      }

      p {
        font-size: 16px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <main class="container">

    <div class="logo">
      Deshi<span>polli</span>
    </div>

    <div class="badge">COMING SOON</div>

    <h1>Something Great<br>is Coming.</h1>

    <p>
      We’re working behind the scenes to bring Deshipolli to life.
      Stay tuned — something exciting is on the way.
    </p>

    <div class="footer">
      © 2026 Deshipolli. All rights reserved.
    </div>

  </main>

</body>
</html>
